  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 3802.06 Payment of Defaults. A defendant may pay any fines, penalty assessments and fees resulting from a defaulted summons, by following the procedures set forth in Saf-C 3802.05.\n\nSource. #5539, eff 1-1-93; ss by #6891, eff 11-25-98, EXPIRED: 11-25-06\n\nNew. #8823, eff 2-21-07; ss by #10825, eff 5-14-15\n\nAPPENDIX\n\nRULE | STATUTE\n\nSaf-C 3801.01 | RSA 541-A:7\n\nSaf-C 3801.02 | RSA 259:19\n\nSaf-C 3801.03 | RSA 259:22\n\nSaf-C 3801.04 | RSA 541-A:7\n\nSaf-C 3802.01-3802.06 | RSA 262:44",
